{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-8051f4de-8a50-4a12-9e22-f17b8de7a720","name":"用户故事包","version":"v1.0.0","created_at":"2026-09-10T11:19:08.975Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:01.988Z","root_node_id":"us_root","metadata":{"scope":"user-stories","purpose":"workflow"}}
{"type":"node","id":"task003","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-003 src/template.js 模版模块（DSL v1 四段）","description":"parseSchema/checkSchema/evaluate/skeletonLines 四段；十条规则集；evaluate 纯函数只读","content":"【实现说明】新建 src/template.js，零依赖。DSL 字段与 rule id 按 US-002【背景与讨论】定稿；evaluate 用 packet.nodes.has/findByPath/childrenOf（非 throw），禁用 resolveRef；编号连续性基于 changelog 出现过的编号（含 tombstone），并校验 title 编号与节点 id 一致\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 合法 schema JSON WHEN parseSchema THEN 返回规范对象且保留 comment 键，checkSchema 零错误","GIVEN 坏 JSON/正则不可编译/未知规则键/scope.parent 引用不存在/规则引用成环/skeleton id 冲突 WHEN checkSchema THEN 各自逐条返回可读错误，无未捕获异常","GIVEN scope.parent 指向规则 id WHEN evaluate THEN 先求值被引用规则并以其匹配节点集为父集","GIVEN structuralErrors 非空的包 WHEN evaluate THEN 返回单条 rule=packet.structure 违规且跳过逐条评估","GIVEN 容器内存在不匹配任何规则的节点 WHEN evaluate（v1）THEN 放行不报"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.024Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.024Z","version":1,"hash":"96108999634e78bd576f303953fc7b78cba0e62bc84c0c9b0101504de91275fc","tags":["task","template"],"status":"draft"}
