{"type":"node","id":"task007","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-007 两个真实工作流 schema 迁移","description":"user-stories 与 dtp-regression 两套 schema 落地，bind 现有包；.template.dtp 退役并清理 docs 引用","content":"【实现说明】两套 schema 即 DSL 通用性验证；迁移后 docs/templates/README.md 说明新工作流；旧 .template.dtp 标记退役（保留与否由实现时按引用清理成本定，须在文档中说明）\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN docs/templates/user-stories.schema.json 与 dtp-regression.schema.json WHEN dtp template check THEN 零错误","GIVEN bind 后的 docs/user-stories.dtp 与 docs/dtp-regression.dtp WHEN dtp lint THEN error 级违规为空（warn 级如有须逐条确认标注为已知历史）","GIVEN 构造违规包 WHEN 用回归 schema lint THEN ISSUE/OPTIM/FIX 的 title 模式、挂载位置、必填 ext 违规可逐条检出"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.176Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:46:35.783Z","version":2,"hash":"3fa06830974904ac84de367246a47a9746b191c86a4c75cf8e01bb64348b747f","tags":["task","template"],"status":"review"}
